# Density Compare
# Uranium (U) — real density 19.1 g/cm³. equal masses: Uranium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Uranium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 7.5mm color: #00c8c8 at (-20mm, 3.7mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 152.3 g — the water cube is the reference
